# macos/Brewfile — Curated Homebrew bundle for macOS workstation
# Run with: brew bundle --file=macos/Brewfile
# NVM owns the shell's Node default. Formula dependencies may install a separate
# Homebrew Node; the zsh config keeps NVM first without breaking those formulae.

